WEBVTT

00:11.640 --> 00:12.190
Gai.

00:12.750 --> 00:14.810
I-I've parked the car at the company.

00:15.190 --> 00:15.920
Don't worry.

00:18.070 --> 00:19.280
Be careful with it!

00:20.810 --> 00:21.410
Gai, it was nothing.

00:21.410 --> 00:23.270
J-Just a sound-activated light.

00:25.600 --> 00:26.110
Okay.

00:26.920 --> 00:27.430
Gai.

00:27.760 --> 00:28.820
Alright, alright.

00:29.030 --> 00:30.630
Call me if you need anything.

00:32.000 --> 00:33.160
Alright, Gai.

00:34.320 --> 00:35.030
Alright.

00:47.840 --> 00:48.970
You must get it fixed

00:49.520 --> 00:50.840
before tonight.

00:52.520 --> 00:53.130
Bro.

00:53.560 --> 00:54.790
Your bumper's completely broken.

00:54.790 --> 00:56.030
I'll have to replace it with a new one.

00:56.030 --> 00:57.030
Replace it then!

00:58.280 --> 00:59.240
Anyway, before tonight,

00:59.240 --> 01:00.860
you have to get it fixed.

01:01.030 --> 01:01.600
Alright?

01:15.640 --> 01:17.840
I'll go get the money for you right away.

01:19.430 --> 01:20.140
Daddy.

02:40.870 --> 02:44.620
[Born with Luck]

02:44.720 --> 02:47.610
[Episode 17]

02:48.910 --> 02:49.970
What are you doing!

02:50.440 --> 02:51.850
Trying to hit me, huh?

02:53.079 --> 02:54.240
What are you thinking?

02:54.240 --> 02:55.190
Trying to escape?

02:55.190 --> 02:56.400
My people are all over this place.

02:56.400 --> 02:58.260
Don't even think about escaping!

03:02.520 --> 03:03.320
Chao.

03:04.190 --> 03:04.870
This God of Wealth statue

03:04.870 --> 03:05.800
looks like ours.

03:07.080 --> 03:08.740
You know what, it really does.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.120
Where did

03:10.750 --> 03:12.050
you two pop out from?

03:12.120 --> 03:12.680
Shut up.

03:14.910 --> 03:16.070
We're robbers.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.430
Robbers?

03:18.310 --> 03:19.410
The two of you?

03:20.430 --> 03:22.240
You don't even know who I am, do you?

03:22.240 --> 03:23.230
Shut up.

03:23.840 --> 03:24.970
Now, can the two of us

03:26.280 --> 03:27.300
rob you or not?

03:28.079 --> 03:29.190
Can we or not?

03:29.910 --> 03:30.530
Sorry.

03:31.710 --> 03:32.770
I was just kidding.

03:34.120 --> 03:34.910
Someone!

03:38.840 --> 03:40.040
Is that Rong's voice?

03:41.780 --> 03:43.650
Yeah. That's pretty loud.

03:46.190 --> 03:47.590
There's no one else here.

03:47.680 --> 03:48.960
Didn't we see all his men leave

03:48.960 --> 03:50.190
when we came in?

03:59.190 --> 04:00.750
Wait. You want money, right?

04:00.750 --> 04:01.880
I've got money here.

04:03.280 --> 04:03.750
This—

04:05.000 --> 04:05.950
all yours.

04:06.400 --> 04:07.060
Take it all.

04:07.240 --> 04:07.900
Don't move.

04:08.710 --> 04:09.710
Just this little?

04:11.680 --> 04:12.840
I-I don't keep

04:13.590 --> 04:14.530
cash at home.

04:14.750 --> 04:15.870
Don't you usually brag

04:15.870 --> 04:17.930
that your house is loaded with money?

04:19.000 --> 04:19.360
Wh...

04:19.870 --> 04:21.120
When did I ever say that?

04:21.120 --> 04:22.380
You're asking me when?

04:24.540 --> 04:25.870
Can I transfer it to you?

04:26.040 --> 04:27.570
Do you think we're so stupid

04:27.800 --> 04:29.260
as to take a bank transfer?

04:29.430 --> 04:31.260
Then that's all the cash I have.

04:31.390 --> 04:32.120
I hate people

04:32.150 --> 04:33.880
who are full of hot air the most.

04:35.150 --> 04:37.210
We only got this little bit in the end?

04:41.270 --> 04:41.850
Don't!

04:44.510 --> 04:46.310
There's money in that suitcase.

04:46.920 --> 04:49.270
You can take all the money
in that suitcase.

04:49.270 --> 04:50.930
Let me keep my phone, will you?

04:51.170 --> 04:52.130
There are...

04:52.360 --> 04:55.290
There are photos of
a deceased relative of mine on it.

04:59.190 --> 04:59.720
Is it him?

05:22.830 --> 05:24.760
Is this the money you talked about?

05:36.810 --> 05:37.700
One million.

05:38.720 --> 05:39.380
US dollars.

05:40.520 --> 05:42.580
Let me keep some memories, okay?

05:44.750 --> 05:46.210
You can take all the money.

05:46.510 --> 05:47.360
But please,

05:47.800 --> 05:48.930
let me keep my phone.

05:51.190 --> 05:53.770
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

05:52.920 --> 05:54.380
You're a sentimental guy.

05:54.700 --> 05:55.960
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

05:57.040 --> 05:59.290
It's just a shabby phone anyway.
Here you are.

05:57.450 --> 06:00.000
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

06:00.270 --> 06:01.310
Thank you.

06:00.740 --> 06:01.210
♪ Love you ♪

06:02.950 --> 06:04.110
That's not right.

06:05.070 --> 06:06.280
You are lying to us.

06:06.390 --> 06:06.630
No.

06:06.750 --> 06:08.270
It's just a shabby phone.

06:10.920 --> 06:11.530
Password.

06:12.430 --> 06:13.960
Let me see the other photos.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.100
I have no idea.

06:16.120 --> 06:17.630
You don't know the password
to your own phone?

06:17.630 --> 06:18.800
How can you not know?

06:20.360 --> 06:20.920
Chao.

06:21.510 --> 06:22.460
He saw my face.

06:22.630 --> 06:23.310
I didn't.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.990
This is not over.

06:26.190 --> 06:27.040
Spare him. He's still useful.

06:27.040 --> 06:27.560
Useful.

06:30.440 --> 06:31.970
Do you have a business card?

06:34.480 --> 06:35.659
[Zhou Rong, Chairman]

06:39.040 --> 06:40.159
Mr. Zhou, if you call the police

06:40.159 --> 06:41.120
after you wake up,

06:41.120 --> 06:41.920
then this phone will...

06:41.920 --> 06:42.870
I absolutely won't.

06:42.870 --> 06:43.870
Never come back.

06:44.270 --> 06:44.870
I won't.

06:45.740 --> 06:47.040
Our main job today

06:47.070 --> 06:48.020
is robbery.

06:48.800 --> 06:49.680
As for business matters,

06:49.680 --> 06:51.140
we can discuss them later.

06:51.390 --> 06:53.320
We'll contact you when you wake up.

06:53.870 --> 06:55.330
What do you mean "wake up"?

06:58.040 --> 06:59.240
What do you want to do?

07:00.870 --> 07:01.600
It hurts.

07:32.520 --> 07:34.250
Chief Zhang, what should we do?

07:37.940 --> 07:38.870
You go in with me.

07:38.980 --> 07:39.920
The rest of you, wait here.

07:39.920 --> 07:40.390
Yes.

07:42.190 --> 07:43.650
W-Who are you looking for?

07:44.680 --> 07:45.560
I'm the Deputy Chief

07:45.560 --> 07:46.480
of Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau,

07:46.480 --> 07:47.280
Zhang Yi'ang.

07:47.390 --> 07:48.650
I want to see Zhou Rong.

07:48.750 --> 07:50.409
Please wait here for a moment.

08:42.120 --> 08:42.780
Stop there.

08:45.750 --> 08:46.750
Stop right there!

08:50.910 --> 08:53.040
I need to see Mr. Zhou about something.

09:01.910 --> 09:03.240
She's a police officer.

09:04.630 --> 09:05.560
Go check on Rong.

09:20.910 --> 09:21.750
Put it down!

09:22.630 --> 09:23.240
Police.

09:25.270 --> 09:26.000
Officers,

09:26.390 --> 09:27.080
she's a thief!

09:27.080 --> 09:29.280
-I was trying to catch a thief.
-Enough.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.790
She's also a police officer.

09:30.790 --> 09:33.250
What were you trying to do
in broad daylight?

09:34.480 --> 09:36.600
Does being police mean you can just
trespass into a private residence?

09:36.600 --> 09:37.240
I should ask you what you want to do

09:37.240 --> 09:39.100
in broad daylight instead, okay?

09:43.270 --> 09:43.750
Chief.

09:44.550 --> 09:45.480
Zhou Rong was robbed

09:45.480 --> 09:46.080
by two masked men.

09:46.080 --> 09:46.810
In the study.

09:49.360 --> 09:50.360
Did you hear that?

09:50.390 --> 09:50.890
He was rob...

09:50.890 --> 09:52.140
There was a robbery.

09:52.390 --> 09:53.440
This is a crime scene.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.910
We're going to
conduct an investigation now.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.200
No, no need to investigate.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.480
No need to investigate.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.410
Chief Zhang.

09:59.320 --> 10:00.550
I was just having a drink

10:00.550 --> 10:01.600
with 2 friends over there.

10:01.600 --> 10:02.000
So,

10:02.120 --> 10:03.320
there was no robbery.

10:04.240 --> 10:05.240
Did you hear that?

10:05.240 --> 10:06.360
There was no robbery.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.790
Since there was no robbery,
then you're trespassing.

10:07.790 --> 10:09.590
I'm acting in self-defense now!

10:11.440 --> 10:12.200
Didn't you just say

10:12.200 --> 10:13.040
I was a thief?

10:13.270 --> 10:14.240
If the police are catching a thief,

10:14.240 --> 10:15.640
how is that trespassing?

10:16.440 --> 10:17.390
Chief, hurry to the study.

10:17.390 --> 10:18.150
N-No need.

10:18.790 --> 10:19.600
You're...

10:22.680 --> 10:23.820
You're also

10:24.000 --> 10:25.400
a guest I invited, right?

10:27.030 --> 10:27.760
Chief Zhang.

10:28.000 --> 10:29.050
Everyone here today

10:29.050 --> 10:30.050
was invited by me.

10:30.240 --> 10:31.360
Everything in my house is peaceful

10:31.360 --> 10:32.270
and perfectly fine today.

10:32.270 --> 10:32.840
Really.

10:33.550 --> 10:34.680
Put the sticks down.

10:38.630 --> 10:39.750
He really was robbed.

10:39.750 --> 10:41.210
A whole suitcase of money.

10:42.200 --> 10:42.750
Mr. Zhou,

10:43.200 --> 10:44.360
tell us if you lost anything.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.510
We will help you get it back.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.080
I didn't.

10:46.630 --> 10:47.120
You see, Chief Zhang,

10:47.120 --> 10:48.000
with you in charge of Sanjiangkou,

10:48.000 --> 10:49.240
who would dare to commit a robbery?

10:49.240 --> 10:50.200
Who would dare to rob

10:50.200 --> 10:51.840
a suitcase of money from someone's study
in broad daylight, right?

10:51.840 --> 10:52.370
Besides,

10:52.390 --> 10:53.080
how could there be

10:53.080 --> 10:54.670
a suitcase of money in a study, right?

10:54.670 --> 10:55.630
Also, look around—

10:55.630 --> 10:57.090
it's like a fortress here.

11:04.910 --> 11:05.710
So, no losses?

11:07.150 --> 11:07.880
Really none?

11:10.790 --> 11:12.050
Did you lose anything?

11:12.750 --> 11:13.790
Did you lose anything?

11:13.790 --> 11:14.590
Did you or not?

11:14.600 --> 11:15.550
No, no. I didn't.

11:20.200 --> 11:21.460
Did you lose anything?

11:27.630 --> 11:28.080
No.

11:43.500 --> 11:44.510
How did they get in?

11:44.510 --> 11:45.190
Mr. Zhou.

11:45.440 --> 11:47.080
The police entering
doesn't count as trespassing.

11:47.080 --> 11:48.150
They wanted to see you.

11:48.150 --> 11:49.240
I called you but you didn't answer,

11:49.240 --> 11:50.370
so I brought them in.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.000
Rong...

11:54.000 --> 11:54.720
Shut up!

11:55.150 --> 11:56.240
I was in there yelling for someone
for ages!

11:56.240 --> 11:57.440
How come nobody came?

11:57.720 --> 11:58.870
Is my house somewhere

11:58.870 --> 12:00.330
anyone can just walk into?

12:01.320 --> 12:03.050
Is this how you guard the house?

12:06.000 --> 12:07.000
Aren't you dizzy?

12:07.840 --> 12:08.360
Yes.

12:09.360 --> 12:09.840
I am.

12:10.000 --> 12:11.330
Then fall down already!

12:20.030 --> 12:21.150
Aren't you dizzy? Aren't you?

12:21.150 --> 12:21.840
Aren't you?

12:36.870 --> 12:37.670
Chief,

12:38.080 --> 12:39.240
I really didn't go undercover on my own

12:39.240 --> 12:40.440
without permission.

12:40.550 --> 12:41.750
No one's blaming you.

12:42.550 --> 12:43.810
Tell us what happened.

12:44.550 --> 12:45.080
Mr. Zhou.

12:45.790 --> 12:46.250
Please.

12:50.790 --> 12:51.790
I tried to escape,

12:51.910 --> 12:53.440
but there were people outside.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.750
I heard Zhu Yifei

12:54.790 --> 12:56.850
and Zhou Rong trading the bianzhong.

12:57.750 --> 12:59.210
Keep your eyes on the road.

12:59.750 --> 13:01.080
Trading the bianzhong?

13:02.390 --> 13:03.090
And then?

13:03.240 --> 13:04.510
Then I sneaked out, trying to escape,

13:04.510 --> 13:06.480
but bumped into Zhou Rong
as soon as I got out.

13:06.480 --> 13:08.340
So I had to follow him to the study.

13:08.960 --> 13:11.300
Then two armed men in maid outfits

13:11.390 --> 13:13.270
with their faces covered showed up.

13:13.270 --> 13:14.400
In women's clothes?

13:14.510 --> 13:15.670
-Female...
-Male...

13:15.670 --> 13:16.550
-Male.
-Male.

13:18.520 --> 13:19.770
They knocked me out,

13:20.080 --> 13:21.910
took Zhou Rong's 1 million US dollars,

13:21.910 --> 13:23.120
as well as a phone that was

13:23.120 --> 13:24.320
very important to him.

13:24.320 --> 13:24.960
The wallpaper

13:24.960 --> 13:26.360
was a photo of Lang Bowen.

13:27.150 --> 13:28.450
Then they ran away.

13:29.150 --> 13:30.200
Then I woke up.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.930
And then, you arrived.

13:31.960 --> 13:32.840
You already saw it,

13:32.840 --> 13:33.360
so how could you let them

13:33.360 --> 13:34.490
take the phone away?

13:36.600 --> 13:37.800
I was a bit dizzy then.

13:37.840 --> 13:39.030
B-Being dizzy is no excuse.

13:39.030 --> 13:40.030
That phone is definitely

13:40.030 --> 13:41.000
a very important clue.

13:41.000 --> 13:42.060
Look at you. You...

13:42.440 --> 13:43.270
They were

13:44.030 --> 13:45.090
2 armed fugitives.

13:45.250 --> 13:46.750
You can't expect her to confront them

13:46.750 --> 13:48.950
empty-handed and risk her life, right?

13:50.750 --> 13:52.270
It's important to protect yourself.

13:52.270 --> 13:53.930
You didn't do anything wrong.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.510
R-Rong.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.670
Why are you back so late?

14:13.670 --> 14:15.000
I took our men
and chased them all the way,

14:15.000 --> 14:15.670
almost out of the city,

14:15.670 --> 14:17.120
but we didn't see Zhu Yifei
and the others.

14:17.120 --> 14:18.320
Then halfway through,

14:18.320 --> 14:19.960
I got a call saying

14:19.980 --> 14:20.720
something had happened at home,

14:20.720 --> 14:21.910
so I rushed back immediately.

14:21.910 --> 14:22.870
Where's my medicine?

14:22.870 --> 14:24.330
Give me my medicine first.

14:25.030 --> 14:26.150
Rong, you can't keep taking this medicine.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.200
It's not good for your health.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.730
I'm already not doing well!

14:30.030 --> 14:31.300
Rong, it's okay.

14:31.600 --> 14:32.540
I'm back.

14:32.790 --> 14:33.440
It's okay.

14:41.270 --> 14:41.870
Sit!

14:44.080 --> 14:44.840
Jianren.

14:45.510 --> 14:46.270
My head's already

14:46.270 --> 14:47.080
a mess right now.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.410
Help me figure this out.

14:48.550 --> 14:49.120
Today, Zhu Yifei

14:49.120 --> 14:50.240
was supposed to come for a deal.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.030
Halfway through the transaction,

14:51.030 --> 14:51.870
he took a phone call and left.

14:51.870 --> 14:52.840
He didn't even take the money.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.380
He left me a phone

14:53.380 --> 14:54.980
that belonged to Lang Bowen.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.480
Then out of nowhere,

14:56.480 --> 14:57.280
a policewoman

14:57.790 --> 14:58.880
showed up.

14:59.080 --> 14:59.800
After that

15:00.030 --> 15:00.720
came 2 perverts

15:00.720 --> 15:01.920
dressed as women.

15:02.030 --> 15:03.790
The moment they walked in, they started
grabbing the phone and beating me up.

15:03.790 --> 15:05.000
In my own house, for god's sake,

15:05.000 --> 15:05.840
they kicked me in the ass

15:05.840 --> 15:07.170
and gave me 3 judo chops.

15:07.440 --> 15:08.240
And in the end,

15:08.630 --> 15:10.160
Zhang Yi'ang showed up too.

15:19.120 --> 15:19.840
Tell me—

15:21.030 --> 15:23.490
who's actually trying to
screw me over here?

15:23.900 --> 15:24.900
Zhu Yifei,

15:25.840 --> 15:26.970
those two perverts,

15:28.320 --> 15:29.250
or Zhang Yi'ang?

15:32.720 --> 15:33.240
Maybe...

15:33.240 --> 15:33.960
Speak Chinese!

15:33.960 --> 15:35.220
They're all possible!

15:51.630 --> 15:52.800
Call Lang Bowen.

15:56.600 --> 15:58.720
Why call him at a time like this?

16:00.410 --> 16:01.670
He caused the trouble,

16:02.360 --> 16:04.160
so have him clean up his own mess.

16:05.360 --> 16:05.840
Okay.

16:12.600 --> 16:13.320
Rong,

16:13.790 --> 16:15.480
you must be joking.

16:16.150 --> 16:17.120
Do I sound like

16:17.390 --> 16:18.360
I'm joking?

16:25.960 --> 16:27.560
So it really happened, Rong?

16:28.480 --> 16:29.530
How could it be?

16:31.960 --> 16:33.840
What do you want me to do then?

16:35.960 --> 16:37.390
Figure it out yourself.

16:41.320 --> 16:42.000
Rong?

16:44.390 --> 16:45.120
Rong?

17:08.400 --> 17:09.400
[Fang Yong]

17:09.829 --> 17:10.640
Sorry,

17:10.920 --> 17:12.310
the user you dialed is busy.

17:12.310 --> 17:13.680
Please try again later.

17:13.750 --> 17:14.339
Sorry,

17:14.440 --> 17:16.670
the user you dialed is busy.

17:16.720 --> 17:18.130
Please try again later.

17:18.200 --> 17:19.130
What's going on?

17:24.000 --> 17:25.030
You guys...

17:29.790 --> 17:31.250
Gathering together, huh?

17:31.750 --> 17:33.510
Letting Liu Bei ran away just like that!

17:33.510 --> 17:34.790
With so many of you there!

17:34.790 --> 17:35.920
Trying to hide, huh?

17:36.510 --> 17:38.030
You didn't even notice a thing.

17:38.030 --> 17:39.780
You didn't even notice a thing!

17:40.070 --> 17:41.350
There are 9 bianzhong in total,

17:41.350 --> 17:42.440
and we already have 8.

17:42.440 --> 17:44.160
We're only missing a small one, right?

17:44.160 --> 17:46.490
So I think the loss
is still under control!

17:51.980 --> 17:53.580
"The loss is under control."

17:55.350 --> 17:56.810
The loss is under control?

17:58.270 --> 17:59.520
Those 9 are a set.

18:00.000 --> 18:00.760
You lost one,

18:00.790 --> 18:01.520
so it's no longer a set.

18:01.520 --> 18:03.320
Who do you expect me to sell it to?

18:03.830 --> 18:05.310
A pair of shoes is worth 10,000 yuan,

18:05.310 --> 18:06.650
and you lost one of them.

18:07.160 --> 18:09.560
Who do you expect me to sell
the other one to?

18:18.580 --> 18:20.240
Alright, I heard everything.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.510
Why do this?

18:22.440 --> 18:24.010
They are all honest kids.

18:24.350 --> 18:25.790
We're a family.

18:26.960 --> 18:28.080
We're a team,

18:28.110 --> 18:29.070
not a gang!

18:31.000 --> 18:31.860
Who did you hit?

18:32.590 --> 18:33.590
For talking back.

18:34.350 --> 18:34.960
Get up.

18:37.830 --> 18:38.630
Go take a rest.

18:42.550 --> 18:43.940
G-Get lost!

18:53.510 --> 18:54.110
Uncle.

18:55.010 --> 18:57.550
[Pinghe] [Liu Bei's location]

18:55.350 --> 18:56.840
Do you think Liu Bei

18:57.070 --> 18:58.930
will ask for an exorbitant price?

18:59.200 --> 19:01.830
Liu Bei broke the rules of our trade.

19:02.510 --> 19:03.880
He must be taken care of.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.320
Zheng, oh Zheng.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.080
They all say

19:10.350 --> 19:12.030
the underworld is dangerous,

19:12.590 --> 19:14.880
but it's also addictive

19:15.680 --> 19:17.350
because it's so charming.

19:21.960 --> 19:22.970
Let me tell you—

19:24.110 --> 19:25.480
every suitcase

19:25.510 --> 19:27.070
has a hidden compartment.

19:27.550 --> 19:29.250
I put a small tracker

19:29.440 --> 19:31.680
in every hidden compartment,

19:31.720 --> 19:33.680
just in case.

19:34.350 --> 19:35.750
When I checked the phone,

19:36.200 --> 19:38.680
the tracker was moving.
What does that tell us?

19:38.680 --> 19:40.440
Liu Bei can't get away.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.720
Where are you going?

19:43.790 --> 19:45.310
Trying to kill him in broad daylight?

19:45.310 --> 19:45.830
Wait,

19:46.920 --> 19:48.180
are we not killing him?

19:48.680 --> 19:50.310
Of course we'll kill him,

19:50.640 --> 19:52.510
and it will be bloody.

19:54.680 --> 19:56.210
Let's chop him into pieces.

19:57.790 --> 19:58.850
You bring him here,

19:59.880 --> 20:01.280
and I'll do the chopping.

20:03.720 --> 20:04.450
Okey-dokey.

20:15.430 --> 20:17.880
[Police]

20:21.640 --> 20:22.700
What are you doing?

20:25.440 --> 20:26.380
My neck hurts.

20:26.830 --> 20:28.490
Go to the hospital if it hurts.

20:29.270 --> 20:30.130
Go do your work.

20:46.960 --> 20:48.580
[Baoku Fresh Produce Delivery Center]

21:04.590 --> 21:06.250
Come on, let's have a meeting.

21:13.000 --> 21:13.510
Guys,

21:14.180 --> 21:15.710
let's have a quick meeting.

21:16.880 --> 21:19.040
First, let's talk about Li Qian.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.200
Chief Qi,

21:20.270 --> 21:21.240
I really wasn't going undercover.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.300
Did anyone ask you?

21:26.240 --> 21:28.080
We just checked

21:28.160 --> 21:29.440
the surveillance footage

21:29.440 --> 21:30.590
outside the bun shop on Qingchun Street.

21:30.590 --> 21:31.990
It proves that Ms. Li Qian

21:32.110 --> 21:33.840
was indeed forced into the car.

21:33.960 --> 21:35.490
This is already very clear.

21:35.510 --> 21:36.240
But Chief Qi,

21:36.240 --> 21:37.300
this doesn't prove

21:37.310 --> 21:38.970
that she didn't act on her own.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.480
From the time you got into his car

21:41.480 --> 21:42.440
to the time you entered Zhou Rong's house,

21:42.440 --> 21:43.570
so much time passed.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.270
Why didn't you contact the bureau?

21:45.270 --> 21:46.270
I wanted to,

21:47.830 --> 21:49.760
but my phone got smashed the moment

21:50.070 --> 21:50.930
I got in the car.

21:51.000 --> 21:52.030
Captain Wang, you forgot.

21:52.030 --> 21:53.130
I tried to call her,

21:53.350 --> 21:54.550
but you didn't let me.

21:54.690 --> 21:55.510
Song Xing!

21:55.790 --> 21:56.240
You see,

21:56.240 --> 21:57.400
I just called Li Qian,

21:57.400 --> 21:58.400
but she suddenly hung up on me.

21:58.400 --> 21:59.200
I wanted to ask what was going on,

21:59.200 --> 22:00.400
but now I can't get through to her.

22:00.400 --> 22:02.600
Is this really the time to be doing that?

22:09.110 --> 22:10.400
Let's put this matter aside for now.

22:10.400 --> 22:11.660
Let it slide, alright?

22:11.830 --> 22:13.760
Let's talk about the case instead.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.650
According to the report

22:15.680 --> 22:17.720
from our colleagues
staking out Zhou Rong's villa,

22:17.720 --> 22:18.890
after we left,

22:19.400 --> 22:20.720
the security team from Zhou Rong's company

22:20.720 --> 22:22.250
and Hu Jianren rushed over.

22:23.350 --> 22:25.240
This shows that the intelligence
provided by Li Qian

22:25.240 --> 22:26.150
was correct,

22:26.440 --> 22:28.570
that Zhou Rong had indeed been robbed.

22:28.680 --> 22:29.940
Li Qian, tell everyone

22:30.110 --> 22:32.240
the basic characteristics of
those 2 robbers.

22:32.240 --> 22:33.590
Both robbers were

22:33.640 --> 22:34.900
about 1.8 meters tall.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.310
One was more heavily built,

22:36.310 --> 22:37.370
the other thinner.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.750
They were both wearing maid outfits

22:39.750 --> 22:40.830
and had their faces covered.

22:40.830 --> 22:43.070
They actually dared to break into
Zhou Rong's house and rob him.

22:43.070 --> 22:44.310
I'm afraid they're no ordinary people.

22:44.310 --> 22:45.040
Chief Zhang.

22:45.590 --> 22:46.440
Could they be those 2 people

22:46.440 --> 22:47.500
who killed Lin Kai?

22:52.630 --> 22:56.440
[September 3, 2012]

22:59.480 --> 23:00.940
Judging from their builds

23:01.350 --> 23:02.790
and gaits,

23:03.920 --> 23:05.250
they did look like them.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.680
Captain Wang, what are your thoughts?

23:20.680 --> 23:21.970
Tell us what you think.

23:25.110 --> 23:26.090
If we try to cover everything at once,

23:26.090 --> 23:28.150
we definitely won't have enough manpower.

23:28.150 --> 23:30.150
We need to keep monitoring Zhou Rong

23:30.350 --> 23:31.710
and keep searching for

23:31.790 --> 23:32.990
Liu Bei and Zhu Yifei.

23:33.270 --> 23:34.160
But I think the main focus

23:34.160 --> 23:35.720
should be on those 2 robbers.

23:35.720 --> 23:37.480
Because the phone is in their hands,
after all.

23:37.480 --> 23:38.200
That phone is definitely

23:38.200 --> 23:39.890
the key to cracking this case.

23:40.750 --> 23:41.500
I disagree.

23:42.790 --> 23:44.590
I think the key should be Liu Bei.

23:46.070 --> 23:46.610
Li Qian.

23:46.750 --> 23:48.160
Regarding the matter

23:48.160 --> 23:48.920
of you going undercover,

23:48.920 --> 23:49.570
I...

23:50.240 --> 23:51.110
It was my mistake.

23:51.110 --> 23:52.310
I... I apologize to you.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.200
But don't bring your emotions

23:53.200 --> 23:54.250
into work,

23:54.400 --> 23:54.930
alright?

23:54.960 --> 23:56.290
I didn't, Captain Wang.

23:57.070 --> 23:57.950
I really think

23:58.160 --> 23:59.690
the focus should be Liu Bei.

23:59.720 --> 24:00.960
Then why is it not Lang Bowen?

24:00.960 --> 24:01.620
Keep quiet.

24:02.200 --> 24:02.640
But

24:02.790 --> 24:03.160
why

24:03.200 --> 24:04.200
can't it be Lang Bowen?

24:04.200 --> 24:05.110
It should be Liu Bei.

24:05.110 --> 24:05.840
The robbers.

24:05.880 --> 24:06.480
Question:

24:08.550 --> 24:10.380
suppose a student

24:10.510 --> 24:11.770
transfers from Class A

24:11.920 --> 24:12.950
to Class B.

24:13.750 --> 24:14.550
Is it possible

24:14.550 --> 24:16.160
that because of his transfer,

24:16.160 --> 24:17.480
the average IQ of

24:17.510 --> 24:18.510
both classes

24:19.630 --> 24:20.630
increases?

24:22.200 --> 24:22.880
For Class A,

24:27.640 --> 24:28.500
it's possible.

24:29.790 --> 24:31.560
If that student's IQ

24:32.400 --> 24:34.490
is lower than Class A's average

24:34.680 --> 24:36.610
but higher than Class B's average,

24:36.920 --> 24:38.030
then after he transfers,

24:38.030 --> 24:39.160
the average IQ of both classes

24:39.160 --> 24:40.020
will increase.

24:42.550 --> 24:43.200
Correct.

24:44.030 --> 24:45.330
So the key is

24:45.400 --> 24:46.930
the one with the highest IQ?

24:47.070 --> 24:47.680
Wrong.

24:48.070 --> 24:49.310
It's the one who poses the greatest threat

24:49.310 --> 24:50.550
to society among those people.

24:50.550 --> 24:51.110
Wrong.

24:52.000 --> 24:53.200
Wait, what does this have

24:53.200 --> 24:54.310
to do with the case?

24:54.590 --> 24:55.450
Nothing at all.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.860
I just said that

24:56.880 --> 24:57.690
to break

24:57.720 --> 24:58.850
the tension just now

24:59.040 --> 25:00.110
and let everyone relax a bit.

25:00.110 --> 25:00.750
Because arguing won't

25:00.750 --> 25:01.880
lead to any results.

25:05.310 --> 25:07.400
But we really should
investigate Lang Bowen.

25:07.400 --> 25:07.960
Why?

25:08.790 --> 25:09.460
Why?

25:09.550 --> 25:11.400
The phone is in the robbers' hands now.

25:11.400 --> 25:12.200
Why not follow

25:12.200 --> 25:13.960
Captain Wang's idea to find the robbers?

25:13.960 --> 25:14.750
Because those two

25:14.750 --> 25:16.150
had their faces covered.

25:16.200 --> 25:17.440
And ever since Lin Kai's incident,

25:17.440 --> 25:18.550
we've been looking for them,

25:18.550 --> 25:20.070
but we haven't found them so far.

25:20.070 --> 25:21.110
Without new clues,

25:21.110 --> 25:22.170
how do we find them?

25:22.750 --> 25:23.610
Good question.

25:23.680 --> 25:24.030
Captain Wang,

25:24.030 --> 25:25.310
have you considered this question?

25:25.310 --> 25:27.070
What's the point of
investigating Lang Bowen?

25:27.070 --> 25:28.610
Right now, we only know

25:28.640 --> 25:29.920
the wallpaper on that phone

25:29.920 --> 25:30.720
was Lang Bowen,

25:30.720 --> 25:32.510
so we're assuming the phone is his.

25:32.510 --> 25:33.480
If you go to him,

25:33.510 --> 25:34.330
will he just tell you everything

25:34.330 --> 25:35.150
and confess?

25:35.400 --> 25:35.880
See,

25:36.150 --> 25:37.410
that's your loophole.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.310
Why look for Liu Bei?

25:39.310 --> 25:40.110
Zhou Rong and Zhu Yifei

25:40.110 --> 25:41.270
didn't complete the deal.

25:41.270 --> 25:43.160
I presume it was because of Liu Bei.

25:43.160 --> 25:44.140
Could it be

25:44.240 --> 25:46.300
that Liu Bei took the bianzhong away?

25:46.590 --> 25:48.190
If that was really the case,

25:48.790 --> 25:49.830
then neither Zhou Rong nor Zhu Yifei

25:49.830 --> 25:50.830
would let him off.

25:50.880 --> 25:52.560
His life might be in danger.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.400
We have to find him as soon as possible.

25:54.400 --> 25:56.320
Also, we've obtained Liu Bei's

25:56.350 --> 25:57.680
physical description,

25:57.720 --> 26:00.120
so it should be relatively easy
to find him.

26:02.790 --> 26:03.320
Chief Qi.

26:04.110 --> 26:05.840
That's also what I'm thinking.

26:19.960 --> 26:20.400
Water.

26:26.030 --> 26:26.640
Uncle,

26:27.000 --> 26:28.200
when does it get dark?

26:29.200 --> 26:30.180
What's the rush?

26:30.750 --> 26:32.080
Same time as yesterday.

26:33.240 --> 26:35.040
You really are to blame for this.

26:35.310 --> 26:36.840
I told you back then that...

26:37.550 --> 26:38.160
Well,

26:38.200 --> 26:39.660
I also made a huge mistake.

26:42.310 --> 26:43.230
Zheng,

26:43.680 --> 26:45.900
I know you're a good kid.

26:46.270 --> 26:48.440
You're just a bit careless
when you handle things.

26:48.440 --> 26:50.500
You need to pay attention to details.

26:51.030 --> 26:52.240
Don't worry. I

26:52.590 --> 26:54.030
will definitely get the bianzhong
back for you.

26:54.030 --> 26:56.230
I promise I won't let you down this time.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.210
Also,

26:57.240 --> 26:58.400
when you handle things,

26:58.400 --> 26:59.330
don't rush them.

26:59.920 --> 27:02.050
Make sure you're doing it right first,

27:02.270 --> 27:03.600
then worry about speed.

27:06.550 --> 27:07.810
Right, one more thing.

27:08.720 --> 27:10.030
Every time you come back
from killing someone,

27:10.030 --> 27:11.430
you're covered in blood.

27:11.440 --> 27:12.590
It looks terrible.

27:13.020 --> 27:14.700
Clothes don't come for free.

27:15.440 --> 27:17.000
Even if you're rich,

27:17.200 --> 27:19.060
you shouldn't waste it like this.

27:21.440 --> 27:22.570
Understood, Uncle.

27:23.070 --> 27:23.790
Details.

27:24.920 --> 27:25.480
Alright.

27:25.920 --> 27:27.790
Go check if the meat is perfectly stewed.

27:27.790 --> 27:28.720
Get ready to eat.

27:36.690 --> 27:41.860
[Fenglinwan]

27:50.920 --> 27:51.550
You're here.

27:51.550 --> 27:52.310
Mine?

27:52.350 --> 27:53.490
All yours, bro.

27:53.830 --> 27:54.690
Mine?

27:54.720 --> 27:55.450
Yeah, yours.

27:55.480 --> 27:56.480
Go on and drink it.

28:00.350 --> 28:02.680
Cheers.

28:06.070 --> 28:06.760
Yibo,

28:06.920 --> 28:08.370
you should go in and talk to him.

28:08.370 --> 28:10.790
He'll drink himself to death
if he goes on like this.

28:10.790 --> 28:12.180
Why bother?

28:12.350 --> 28:14.090
Bowen is rarely this happy.

28:18.160 --> 28:19.880
Let him drink as much as he wants.

28:19.880 --> 28:20.880
We've got plenty.

28:32.830 --> 28:35.410
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

28:36.340 --> 28:37.600
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

28:39.090 --> 28:41.640
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

28:42.380 --> 28:43.820
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

28:45.130 --> 28:45.930
♪ Oh Gimme ♪

28:47.050 --> 28:48.890
♪ Dance me in the richness ♪

28:50.050 --> 28:51.740
♪ Raining make it rain ♪

28:52.180 --> 28:54.870
♪ Oh cash is my revolution ♪

28:57.510 --> 28:59.990
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

29:00.870 --> 29:02.270
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

29:03.610 --> 29:06.100
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

29:06.020 --> 29:07.750
[No SIM card] [No service]

29:12.200 --> 29:13.400
Every time I look at this bastard,

29:13.400 --> 29:14.200
I get furious.

29:15.200 --> 29:16.160
What's the rush?

29:16.510 --> 29:17.970
A real man should stay calm

29:18.400 --> 29:20.160
even when Mount Tai collapses before him,

29:20.160 --> 29:22.640
and remain unshaken even when
a fierce tiger is behind him.

29:22.640 --> 29:24.300
Let's give him a chance to try.

29:25.060 --> 29:27.820
[No SIM card] [No service]

29:28.020 --> 29:28.420
[You've entered the password incorrectly
5 times.]

29:28.440 --> 29:28.780
[Please try again in 30 seconds.]

29:29.750 --> 29:30.530
Stop trying.

29:31.070 --> 29:32.550
So it locks for 10 minutes
if I get it wrong, what's the big deal?

29:32.550 --> 29:33.670
But I heard

29:33.790 --> 29:35.510
if you enter the wrong password
10 times in a row,

29:35.510 --> 29:37.370
all the data inside will be wiped.

29:38.710 --> 29:40.530
[No SIM card] [No service]

29:41.750 --> 29:42.720
If this bastard isn't dead,

29:42.720 --> 29:44.180
I'll definitely kill him.

29:47.720 --> 29:48.270
Chao,

29:48.880 --> 29:50.190
what should we do next?

29:51.590 --> 29:52.270
Tomorrow morning,

29:52.270 --> 29:53.730
we'll leave Sanjiangkou.

29:54.480 --> 29:56.790
I'll take you somewhere else
to enjoy life.

29:56.790 --> 29:57.240
Wait,

29:57.510 --> 29:59.240
so we're giving up on this deal?

30:01.400 --> 30:03.350
A man who's never content is like
a snake trying to swallow an elephant—

30:03.350 --> 30:04.480
that's exactly you.

30:05.240 --> 30:07.440
Sanjiangkou is Zhou Rong's territory.

30:07.510 --> 30:09.110
He's rich and powerful here.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.440
Even if he's willing to pay a ransom,

30:10.440 --> 30:12.170
would we really dare to take it?

30:13.510 --> 30:15.310
Let's leave Sanjiangkou first.

30:15.310 --> 30:17.070
We can deal with the phone later.

30:17.070 --> 30:18.920
Money can never be earned out completely.

30:18.920 --> 30:20.250
Life is more important—

30:20.640 --> 30:21.270
a lot more.

30:23.480 --> 30:24.400
Makes sense.

30:25.510 --> 30:27.160
Then if we leave tomorrow,

30:27.240 --> 30:28.570
what are we doing today?

30:28.880 --> 30:29.960
Tonight, I'll take you out

30:29.960 --> 30:31.430
to enjoy ourselves.

30:38.030 --> 30:38.550
Chao,

30:39.350 --> 30:41.410
this place must be expensive, right?

30:41.590 --> 30:42.980
Can't we afford it?

30:44.240 --> 30:44.880
Besides,

30:44.920 --> 30:46.110
don't we have this?

30:45.740 --> 30:47.520
[Spa Card]
[Fenglinwan VIP Exclusive]

30:48.350 --> 30:49.200
We've been like frogs at the bottom

30:49.200 --> 30:50.600
of a well for so many days.

30:52.120 --> 30:53.270
Tonight, I'll take you to enjoy

30:53.270 --> 30:54.530
something luxurious.

31:09.640 --> 31:11.790
Chao, is there something wrong
with this guy?

31:11.790 --> 31:12.790
This way, please.

31:14.680 --> 31:15.280
Am I right?

31:15.310 --> 31:16.110
Right.

31:16.160 --> 31:16.890
Right.

31:17.110 --> 31:18.410
Then let's play dice.

31:18.550 --> 31:19.310
Bro, come on.

31:19.350 --> 31:20.250
Come on.

31:20.590 --> 31:21.240
I've called 15.

31:21.240 --> 31:21.890
-15.
-20.

31:21.910 --> 31:22.300
15!

31:22.350 --> 31:23.200
-10.
-15.

31:23.550 --> 31:24.680
-10. 15.
-Come on.

31:26.200 --> 31:27.480
-15. 10.
-5.

31:28.160 --> 31:28.680
Drink.

31:29.000 --> 31:30.200
You gotta drink this.

31:30.270 --> 31:32.270
-Come on, drink it.
-Drink it for me.

31:33.550 --> 31:35.140
Let me say something!

31:38.720 --> 31:40.550
Stop drinking, you brats.

31:41.680 --> 31:43.700
Go home and find your own mothers.

31:43.830 --> 31:44.880
Who the hell are you?

31:44.880 --> 31:46.070
I'm your daddy,

31:46.110 --> 31:48.000
number one of Sanjiangkou.

31:48.440 --> 31:49.070
Bro. Bro.

31:49.200 --> 31:50.400
This is just a misunderstanding.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.240
L-Let me grandly

31:51.240 --> 31:51.880
introduce him to you all.

31:51.880 --> 31:52.850
This is Mr. Lang,

31:52.920 --> 31:54.550
Mr. Zhou's friend, one of our own.

31:54.550 --> 31:55.550
He drank too much.

31:55.550 --> 31:56.510
Here, I'll drink this on his behalf.

31:56.510 --> 31:57.510
Mr. Zhou's friend?

31:57.510 --> 31:58.480
Pardon my disrespect.

31:58.480 --> 31:59.030
Mr. Lang, why not

31:59.030 --> 32:00.790
sit down and have a drink with us?

32:00.790 --> 32:01.880
Why should I?

32:01.880 --> 32:02.920
Call me daddy!

32:04.960 --> 32:05.550
Daddy.

32:05.550 --> 32:07.010
You're my daddy, alright?

32:07.830 --> 32:08.720
You guys keep drinking.

32:08.720 --> 32:09.880
Let's go home, alright?

32:09.880 --> 32:11.460
Stop drinking, you brats!

32:11.570 --> 32:12.510
Alright, alright. Enough.

32:12.510 --> 32:13.110
Stop drinking!

32:13.110 --> 32:13.880
Go home to your mom!

32:13.880 --> 32:14.510
Right, right.

32:14.510 --> 32:15.310
Easy, please.

32:15.400 --> 32:16.070
Drink less.

32:17.920 --> 32:18.930
Yes, sir.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.640
This is our VIP card.

32:21.830 --> 32:23.480
Can I get a discount with this card?

32:23.480 --> 32:24.440
How much of a discount?

32:24.440 --> 32:25.910
With this card, everything's on the house,

32:25.910 --> 32:26.480
sir.

32:28.160 --> 32:29.610
So everything's free?

32:30.000 --> 32:30.830
Yes, sir.

32:32.150 --> 32:33.480
No matter how much I spend?

32:33.480 --> 32:34.440
Yes, sir.

32:35.750 --> 32:37.070
Then I won't hold back.

32:38.350 --> 32:40.410
Bring me 2 dozen bottles of Snow Beer!

32:59.200 --> 32:59.750
Chao.

33:08.880 --> 33:09.790
There are photos of

33:09.790 --> 33:11.650
a deceased relative of mine on it.

33:16.230 --> 33:16.880
Chao.

33:18.920 --> 33:19.850
You wanna die?

33:20.000 --> 33:20.630
No,

33:21.000 --> 33:23.030
this person isn't dead. He's still alive.

33:23.030 --> 33:24.830
Zhou Rong's deceased relative.

33:42.270 --> 33:43.860
This phone is yours?

33:45.830 --> 33:47.030
What's the password?

33:49.510 --> 33:50.160
One five?

33:52.440 --> 33:53.110
Two fives?

33:54.790 --> 33:55.680
Three fives?

34:06.310 --> 34:07.590
Pat me.

34:08.400 --> 34:10.070
Give me a pat.

34:19.480 --> 34:21.360
Thanks, brat.

34:28.190 --> 34:28.760
Chao,

34:30.070 --> 34:31.270
should we beat him up?

34:31.840 --> 34:33.040
Don't cause trouble.

34:33.150 --> 34:34.900
Just get the phone password.

34:39.630 --> 34:41.560
What's the password to your phone?

34:41.800 --> 34:42.710
Call me daddy,

34:44.590 --> 34:46.260
and I'll tell you.

34:52.320 --> 34:54.650
Daddy, what's the password to your phone?

35:02.230 --> 35:02.890
Beat him up.

35:16.440 --> 35:17.640
♪ He ♪

35:19.330 --> 35:23.450
♪ A rusted flower etched
across his chest ♪

35:25.520 --> 35:26.410
♪ Oh, he ♪

35:28.370 --> 35:31.520
♪ Says your worldview's still too small ♪

35:35.450 --> 35:39.150
♪ A rat that steals rice—
humans call it cunning ♪

35:40.050 --> 35:43.820
♪ A human who steals honey—
calls the bees hardworking ♪

35:44.310 --> 35:45.710
Lang Bowen was beaten up?

35:45.840 --> 35:47.840
Lu Yibo said they hit pretty hard.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.550
Who did it?

35:49.960 --> 35:51.400
Did anyone see their faces clearly?

35:51.400 --> 35:52.280
Two experts.

35:52.550 --> 35:53.680
Very professional.

35:57.230 --> 35:59.360
Could it have been Zhu Yifei who did it?

36:00.480 --> 36:01.510
Besides Huo Zheng,

36:01.510 --> 36:03.520
does he have any other experts under him?

36:03.520 --> 36:04.180
Hard to say.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.030
Could it have been

36:06.030 --> 36:07.430
the 2 guys who robbed you?

36:08.840 --> 36:09.520
Zhu Yifei

36:09.590 --> 36:11.120
sneaked in driving a truck.

36:11.670 --> 36:12.670
It wouldn't be impossible for him

36:12.670 --> 36:14.800
to have brought two people in with him.

36:17.480 --> 36:18.410
Go to the company

36:20.550 --> 36:21.680
and get the gun back.

36:23.070 --> 36:24.410
What about Lang Bowen?

36:24.840 --> 36:26.230
Just have Lu Yibo handle it.

36:26.230 --> 36:27.320
Delete the surveillance footage.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.110
If the police ask,

36:28.110 --> 36:30.510
just say he got drunk
and caused trouble himself.

36:30.510 --> 36:31.920
Okay, I'll go teach him.

36:41.710 --> 36:42.580
Hurry up.

36:42.710 --> 36:43.190
Don't rush me, bro.

36:43.190 --> 36:44.120
I'm almost done.

36:45.550 --> 36:46.480
Okay, done, bro.

36:47.000 --> 36:47.800
How is it, bro?

36:47.920 --> 36:49.720
I did a pretty good job, didn't I?

36:51.920 --> 36:53.220
You really did.

36:53.960 --> 36:54.710
Great job.

37:04.230 --> 37:04.920
Bro, where are you going

37:04.920 --> 37:05.590
in such a hurry?

37:05.590 --> 37:06.550
I must drive the car

37:06.550 --> 37:07.330
back today.

37:08.000 --> 37:08.480
But...

37:16.960 --> 37:17.440
I just

37:17.480 --> 37:19.010
called you daddy, didn't I?

37:19.360 --> 37:21.030
Blood is thicker than water, isn't it?

37:21.030 --> 37:21.480
It is.

37:21.510 --> 37:22.710
Can a son possibly owe his dad money?

37:22.710 --> 37:23.230
Of course not.

37:23.230 --> 37:24.310
There you go.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.800
I'll pay you in a few days!

38:08.770 --> 38:12.170
[Rongcheng]

38:19.440 --> 38:20.030
Hello?

38:21.280 --> 38:21.910
Liu.

38:22.840 --> 38:24.300
I think I forgot to turn off

38:24.320 --> 38:25.630
the space heater in my room.

38:25.630 --> 38:26.890
Can you go check for me?

38:26.960 --> 38:27.710
So it doesn't catch fire.

38:27.710 --> 38:28.560
Look at the weather.

38:27.840 --> 38:29.570
[Gatehouse]

38:28.590 --> 38:30.720
Why are you still using a space heater?

38:31.590 --> 38:33.190
I was drying my insoles this afternoon.

38:33.190 --> 38:36.040
[Gatehouse]

38:34.400 --> 38:35.200
Alright then.

38:39.120 --> 38:41.510
[Rongcheng]

39:27.960 --> 39:30.020
Where's the guard on duty at the gate?

39:30.110 --> 39:30.920
No idea.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.080
You stay here and keep watch.

39:47.880 --> 39:51.630
43 million

39:51.800 --> 39:53.590
divided by 9.

39:56.080 --> 39:58.670
Ones, tens, hundreds,
thousands, 10 thousands,

39:58.670 --> 40:00.840
hundred thousands, millions, 10 millions.

40:00.840 --> 40:03.010
47 million.

40:07.770 --> 40:09.160
47 million.

40:12.480 --> 40:14.960
Rongcheng Group.

40:17.030 --> 40:18.120
Group.

40:18.990 --> 40:21.390
Rongcheng World.

40:21.660 --> 40:24.640
[Contact Information]

40:28.840 --> 40:29.480
Hello.

40:30.550 --> 40:32.010
I want to talk to Zhou Rong.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.580
I sounded too kind.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.640
Have Zhou Rong answer the phone!

40:44.590 --> 40:45.000
R...

40:45.440 --> 40:46.140
Rong.

40:46.710 --> 40:47.770
I've got the stuff.

40:50.190 --> 40:51.730
I've got the stuff.

40:52.630 --> 40:55.670
352866.
